WEBVTT

00:16:28.886 --> 00:16:31.203
is this idea of discipline, of showing up.

00:16:31.227 --> 00:16:32.731
And it's paradoxical, in a way,

00:16:32.755 --> 00:16:35.672
because a lot of people think of
the routine of showing up

00:16:35.696 --> 00:16:38.552
as the antithesis
of what it is to be creative.

00:16:38.576 --> 00:16:40.835
Like, being creative
is being open to the moment

00:16:40.859 --> 00:16:43.353
and going wherever the spirit
leads you, as it were.

00:16:43.377 --> 00:16:46.768
But for you, even though you believe
that there is a spirit

00:16:46.792 --> 00:16:48.378
leading you on key moments,

00:16:48.402 --> 00:16:49.959
you want discipline from people.

00:16:49.983 --> 00:16:53.251
You want them to take seriously
the hard work part of all this.

00:16:53.275 --> 00:16:55.170
EG: Well, that's the devotional part.

00:16:55.194 --> 00:16:57.107
To me, that goes along with mysticism.

00:16:57.131 --> 00:17:00.374
That goes along with the sense
of spirituality and supernatural,